\ Every symbol word on variables, compared with pinned Lean node for node
\ (review of ops-symbols B3 (b), 2026-11-20; plan row S3, slice S3a-ops):
\ the reviewer's probes that elaborate on decide's slice of Init, among them
\ - / % < > ≥ ≤ ≠ ^ (with a variable exponent), ∧ ∨ ↔ ¬ and the ASCII
\ spellings <= >= /\ \/ <->. A hypothesis False proves any statement, true
\ or false, by by-exfalso by-assumption, so only the statement's
\ elaboration is under test: tests/front/tactics/decide/check.py requires
\ each accepted with no axiom and its type and value equal to pinned Lean's
\ (goal-layer.lean, theorem sv_ID, the Lean statement in the comment above
\ each). sy-vars-init.lf has the probes that need all of Init.

